## Plugin
- **Name:** Obsidian Git (Vinzent03/obsidian-git v2.43.0)
- **Installed:** Yes (.obsidian/plugins/obsidian-git/)
- **Enabled:** Yes (community-plugins.json)

## Prerequisites
- Vault must be inside a Git repository.
- Git must be installed and configured (user.name, user.email).

